### =========================================
### AUTENTICACIÓN CLIENTE - CUSTOMER
### =========================================


### 0. [CUSTOMER] Registrar nuevo cliente

POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Francisco Manuel Candela",
  "email": "fran.customer@smartqr.com",
  "password": "Customer123!"
}

### 0.1 [CUSTOMER] Login cliente
### Tras ejecutar esta petición, copia access_token en @customerToken de la cabecera.

POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "fran.customer@smartqr.com",
  "password": "Customer123!"
}

### =========================================
###             PRUEBAS DE CLIENTE
###              (CARTA DESDE QR)
### =========================================

### 1. [CUSTOMER] Ver la carta pública enlazada desde el QR físico de la Mesa 5

GET http://localhost:8080/products/menu?table=5
Accept: application/json

### =========================================
###         PRUEBAS NEGATIVAS
###            (CUSTOMER)
### =========================================

### 2. [CUSTOMER] No puede consultar el inventario completo de administración

GET http://localhost:8080/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 3. [CUSTOMER] No puede generar códigos QR de mesas

POST http://localhost:8080/qr/table/5
Accept: image/png
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### =========================================
###         PEDIDO 1 - PAGO TARJETA
###                 Y TICKET
### =========================================

### 4. [CUSTOMER] Crear una nueva comanda para pagar con tarjeta

POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "tableNumber": 5,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "notes": "Heladas"
    },
    {
      "productId": 3,
      "quantity": 1,
      "notes": "Con hielo extra"
    }
  ]
}

### 5. [CUSTOMER] Ver el estado del Pedido ID 1 antes de pagar

GET http://localhost:8080/orders/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 6. [CUSTOMER] Pagar el Pedido ID 1 con Tarjeta de Crédito

POST http://localhost:8080/payments/card
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "cardHolderName": "Francisco Manuel Candela",
  "last4Digits": "4242",
  "transactionId": "txn_stripe_987654321"
}

### 7. [CUSTOMER] Ver el estado del Pedido ID 1 después de pagar

GET http://localhost:8080/orders/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 8. [CUSTOMER] Descargar ticket del Pedido ID 1 pagado con tarjeta

GET http://localhost:8080/payments/ticket/1
Accept: text/plain
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### =========================================
###     PEDIDO 2 - CASH INSUFICIENTE
### =========================================

### 9. [CUSTOMER] Crear un segundo pedido para probar efectivo insuficiente

POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "tableNumber": 5,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 16,
      "quantity": 2,
      "notes": "Prueba de efectivo insuficiente"
    }
  ]
}

### 10. [CUSTOMER] Intentar pagar el Pedido ID 2 con efectivo insuficiente

POST http://localhost:8080/payments/cash/request
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "orderId": 2,
  "cashReceived": 1.00
}

### 11. [CUSTOMER] Confirmar que no existe ticket para el Pedido ID 2 no pagado
### */* = acepta cualquier respuesta.(devuelve su excepcion) si ponemos application/json devuelve un internal error 500
GET http://localhost:8080/payments/ticket/2
Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### =========================================
###      PEDIDO 3 - CASH PARA CAJA
### =========================================

### 12. [CUSTOMER] Crear un tercer pedido para confirmar el pago en efectivo por empleado

POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "tableNumber": 5,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 16,
      "quantity": 2,
      "notes": "Pedido para validar confirmación cash por empleado"
    }
  ]
}

### 13. [CUSTOMER] Solicitar pago en efectivo suficiente para el Pedido ID 3

POST http://localhost:8080/payments/cash/request
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "orderId": 3,
  "cashReceived": 20.00
}

### 14. [CUSTOMER] No puede confirmar su propio pago en efectivo

PUT http://localhost:8080/payments/cash/3/confirm
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### =========================================
###         PEDIDO 4 - PARA COCINA
### =========================================

### 15. [CUSTOMER] Crear un cuarto pedido pendiente para que lo gestione el empleado

POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "tableNumber": 5,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 16,
      "quantity": 1,
      "notes": "Pedido pendiente para gestión de cocina"
    }
  ]
}

### 16. [CUSTOMER] No puede consultar todos los pedidos de una mesa

GET http://localhost:8080/orders/table/5
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 17. [CUSTOMER] No puede consultar la cola de cocina

GET http://localhost:8080/orders/kitchen/queue
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### =========================================
###     AI FEEDBACK ANALYSIS
### =========================================

### 18. [CUSTOMER] Enviar una opinión positiva y analizar sentimiento con OpenAI

POST http://localhost:8080/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "La comida estaba buenísima y el servicio fue muy rápido. Volvería sin duda."
}

### =========================================
###     AI COMBO RECOMMENDATION
### =========================================

### 19. [CUSTOMER] Solicitar recomendacion automatizada de combo con OpenAI

POST http://localhost:8080/ai/combo-recommendation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "preferences": "Quiero algo variado para compartir, con bebida muy helada para cada uno y con entrantes, si hay algo dulce recomiendame algo, cafe para despues porfavor.",
  "maxBudget": 35.00,
  "numberOfPeople": 5
}


